%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 609984c0f9ea9c94bb267b2f044e0140, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainSubtitles
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entries:
  - id: chemistry_lab_entrance
    note: "Kimya lab\u0131na ilk giri\u015F"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Beni \xFCniversitede geride b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 m\u0131
        sand\u0131n Arthur?"
      textEN: Did you think you left me behind at the university, Arthur?
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Art\u0131k bu rutubetli bodrumun duvarlar\u0131n\u0131n i\xE7indeyim."
      textEN: I am inside the walls of this damp basement now.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Duydu\u011Fun o a\u011F\u0131r ad\u0131mlar... binan\u0131n esnemesi
        de\u011Fil."
      textEN: Those heavy steps you hear... they aren't the building settling.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: Benim.
      textEN: It's me.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Raflara bak. De\u011Ferli verilerini o tozlu kitaplar\u0131n aras\u0131na
        da\u011F\u0131tt\u0131m."
      textEN: Look around at the shelves. I scattered your precious data inside those
        dusty books.
      textDE: 
  - id: start_game
    note: "Kimya lab\u0131na ilk giri\u015F"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\xDCniversitedeki o parlak koltu\u011Fu b\u0131rakmak bir hatayd\u0131
        Arthur."
      textEN: Leaving that bright chair at the university was a mistake, Arthur.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 1
      textTR: "Onlar\u0131n yan\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 kan\u0131tlamak
        i\xE7in kendini bu rutubetli bodruma g\xF6md\xFCn..."
      textEN: You buried yourself in this damp basement to prove them wrong...
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Geceyi sa\u011F \xE7\u0131karmak istiyorsan temellerden ba\u015Fla."
      textEN: If you want to survive the night, start with the basics.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: Masandaki notu al.
      textEN: Pick up the note on your desk.
      textDE: 
  - id: pressure_emergency
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Borulardaki bas\u0131n\xE7 \xE7ok fazla... t\u0131pk\u0131 kafatas\u0131n\u0131n
        i\xE7indeki bas\u0131n\xE7 gibi."
      textEN: Too much pressure in the pipes... just like the pressure inside your
        skull.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Vanay\u0131 bul ve buhar\u0131 bo\u015Falt Arthur!"
      textEN: Find the valve and release the steam, Arthur!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2.5
      textTR: "B\xFCt\xFCn oda y\xFCz\xFCne patlamadan \xF6nce!"
      textEN: Before the whole room blows up in your face!
      textDE: 
  - id: particle_room_entrance
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "K\xFCtle Spektrometresi..."
      textEN: The Mass Spectrometer...
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "M\u0131knat\u0131slar\u0131 birlikte kalibre etti\u011Fimiz zamanlar\u0131
        hat\u0131rl\u0131yor musun?"
      textEN: Remember when we used to calibrate the magnets together?
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: "\u015Eimdi o par\xE7ac\u0131klar da zihnin kadar karars\u0131z."
      textEN: Now, those particles are as unstable as your mind.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "I\u015F\u0131n\u0131 merkeze y\xF6nlendir Arthur. Ellerinin titremesine
        izin verme."
      textEN: Guide the beam to the center, Arthur. Don't let your hands shake.
      textDE: 
  - id: first_notepad
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "G\xFCzel. Okumay\u0131 unutmam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
      textEN: Good. You haven't forgotten how to read.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "\u015Eimdi Turing Makinesi'nin ba\u015F\u0131na ge\xE7."
      textEN: Now, walk over to the Turing Machine.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 1
      textTR: "Az \xF6nce buldu\u011Fun kelimeyi, sembol\xFC ve say\u0131lar\u0131
        gir."
      textEN: Enter the word, the symbol, and the numbers you just found.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: "Bakal\u0131m parmaklar\u0131n \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmam\u0131z\u0131n
        ritmini h\xE2l\xE2 hat\u0131rl\u0131yor mu."
      textEN: Let's see if your fingers still remember the rhythm of our work.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Ben seni bulmadan \xF6nce i\u015Faretlediklerimi bul."
      textEN: Find the ones I marked before I find you.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Ve ses \xE7\u0131karmamaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F."
      textEN: And try not to make a sound.
      textDE: 
  - id: first_mistake
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Yanl\u0131\u015F Arthur! T\u0131pk\u0131 kazaya sebep oldu\u011Fun
        g\xFCnk\xFC gibi \xF6zensiz ve dikkatsiz!"
      textEN: Wrong, Arthur! Sloppy and careless, just like the day you caused the
        accident!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: Odaklan!
      textEN: Focus!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: "O kap\u0131y\u0131 yaln\u0131zca be\u015F do\u011Fru dizilim a\xE7acak."
      textEN: Only five correct sequences will unlock that door.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Radyasyon haf\u0131zan\u0131 da m\u0131 \xE7\xFCr\xFCtt\xFC?"
      textEN: Did the radiation rot your memory too?
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: Defterine bak ve tekrar dene.
      textEN: Look at your notebook and try again.
      textDE: 
  - id: tutorial_solved
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: Etkileyici. Makine girdini kabul etti.
      textEN: Impressive. The machine accepts your input.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Laboratuvar kap\u0131s\u0131ndaki kilidin nas\u0131l tepki verdi\u011Fini
        fark ettin mi?"
      textEN: Notice how the lock on the laboratory door reacted?
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: "Art\u0131k a\xE7\u0131k. G\xFCvenli k\xFC\xE7\xFCk ofisinden d\u0131\u015Far\u0131
        ad\u0131m at... ve ger\xE7ek \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmayla y\xFCzle\u015F."
      textEN: It is open now. Step out of your safe little office... and come face
        the real work.
      textDE: 
  - id: final_code
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Be\u015F dizilim... Hepsi do\u011Fruland\u0131."
      textEN: Five sequences... All validated.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Ger\xE7ekten ba\u015Fard\u0131n Arthur. Par\xE7alanm\u0131\u015F ara\u015Ft\u0131rmam\u0131z\u0131
        yeniden bir araya getirdin."
      textEN: You actually did it, Arthur. You pieced our shattered research back
        together.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 10
      textTR: "Son kilit de a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131."
      textEN: The final lock is released.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 8
      textTR: "Devam et, \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7. Bakal\u0131m
        di\u011Fer tarafta seni ne bekliyor."
      textEN: Go on, open the exit door. Let's see what awaits you on the other side.
      textDE: 
  - id: pressure_room_entrance
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 2
      textTR: "Borular\u0131n y\xFCk alt\u0131nda nas\u0131l inledi\u011Fini dinle."
      textEN: Listen to the pipes groaning under the strain.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: "Buras\u0131 tamamen saatli bir bomba Arthur."
      textEN: This whole place is a ticking time bomb, Arthur.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "T\u0131pk\u0131 in\u015Fa etti\u011Fimiz reakt\xF6r gibi."
      textEN: Just like the reactor we built.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "G\xF6z\xFCn\xFC bas\u0131n\xE7 g\xF6stergelerinden ay\u0131rma."
      textEN: Keep your eyes on the pressure gauges.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 b\xF6lgeye ula\u015F\u0131rlarsa, daha bana
        f\u0131rsat kalmadan buhar seni diri diri ha\u015Flar."
      textEN: If they hit the red zone, the steam will cook you alive before I even
        get the chance.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_001
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 2
      textTR: "\xD6nce masadaki defteri a\xE7\u0131p kalibrasyon notunu almal\u0131y\u0131m."
      textEN: First I must open the notebook on the desk and take the calibration
        note.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_002
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "\u015Eifreyi ald\u0131m. \u015Eimdi bunu Turing makinesine girmem
        gerekiyor."
      textEN: I got the code. Now I need to enter it into the Turing machine.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_003
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: O ses de neydi?... Elektrikler mi kesildi?
      textEN: What was that sound?... Did the power just go out?
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Come on hide in that wardrope hurry.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_004
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Her yer zifiri karanl\u0131k... B\xF6yle \xE7al\u0131\u015Famam. Fenerim
        masan\u0131n \xFCzerinde, onu almal\u0131y\u0131m."
      textEN: Everywhere is pitch black... I can't work like this. Look, my flashlight
        is on the desk, I should take it.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Just wait for he is gone.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_005
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "G\xFCzel, en az\u0131ndan \xF6n\xFCm\xFC g\xF6rebiliyorum. \u015Eimdi
        koridora \xE7\u0131k\u0131p sigorta kutusunu bulmal\u0131 ve elektri\u011Fi
        geri a\xE7mal\u0131y\u0131m."
      textEN: Good, at least I can see ahead. Now I must go out to the corridor,
        find the breaker box, and restore the power.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: You can go out.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Now its time for solve problem
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_006
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "San\u0131r\u0131m ana \u015Fartel koridorun sonundaki odada. Oraya
        bakmal\u0131y\u0131m."
      textEN: I think the main breaker is in the room at the end of the corridor.
        I should check it.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Ju... just  turn around
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: and dont move.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Be calm and wait until he is gone.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_007
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Elektrik geldi, sistemler \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yor. \u015Eimdi
        di\u011Fer odalardaki gizli \u015Fifreleri bulmam gerekiyor."
      textEN: Power is back, the systems are working. Now I need to find the hidden
        passwords in the other rooms.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Now just write that password...
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: into that Machine
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_008
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Bas\u0131n\xE7 g\xF6stergesi tavan yapt\u0131! Kazan dairesindeki
        vanalar\u0131 hemen kapatmazsam buras\u0131 havaya u\xE7acak!"
      textEN: The pressure gauge has spiked! If I don't close the valves in the boiler
        room right now, this place will blow up!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Its increase like maniac.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: You need to turn the valve.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_009
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Bas\u0131n\xE7 normale d\xF6nd\xFC, tehlike ge\xE7ti. \u0130\u015Fe
        geri d\xF6nelim... \u015Eifreleri bulmak i\xE7in raflardaki kitaplar\u0131
        kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rabilirim."
      textEN: Pressure is back to normal, danger has passed. Let's get back to work...
        I can search the books on the shelves to find the passwords.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: what a beauty
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: pul the level in the fuse room.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Which is only room with lights on
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_010
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Bu osiloskoptaki frekans tan\u0131d\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor... Ekrandaki
        dalgay\u0131 e\u015Fle\u015Ftirirsem \u015Fifreyi elde edebilirim."
      textEN: The frequency on this oscilloscope looks familiar... If I match the
        wave on the screen, I can obtain the password.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: But we start now.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: You learn what you need.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Now its time to explode to bomb...
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_011
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Burada bir \u015Fifre var! Birini buldum, bunu not al\u0131p hemen
        Turing makinesinde denemeliyim."
      textEN: There's a password here! I found one, I should note this down and try
        it on the Turing machine right away.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Now check your notebook
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: You need to write everything you know
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_012
    note: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 1.5
      textTR: "Bu ses... Buraya geliyor! Hemen dolab\u0131n i\xE7ine saklanmal\u0131y\u0131m!"
      textEN: That sound... He's coming here! I must hide inside the locker right
        now!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: Dont Forget to close your doors
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: never ever.
      textDE: 
  - id: tut_board_intro
    note: "Kara tahta e\u011Fitiminin kitap ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\xD6nce defterdeki kalibrasyon \u015Femas\u0131na bakmal\u0131y\u0131m.
        [{input:ToggleNotebook}] ile a\xE7\u0131p hedefi ve par\xE7alar\u0131 tahtaya
        s\xFCr\xFCkleyebilirim."
      textEN: First I should check the calibration diagram in my notebook. I can
        open it with [{input:ToggleNotebook}] and drag the target and parts onto
        the board.
      textDE: "\xD6ffne das Buch auf dem Tisch. Ziehe das Ziel, den Hinweis und alle
        drei Teile in dein Notizbuch."
  - id: tut_board_terminal
    note: "\u0130lk \xF6l\xE7\xFCm\xFCn Turing kontrol\xFC"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Sentez tamamland\u0131. Tahtan\u0131n verdi\u011Fi kodu Turing makinesine
        girersem kilit a\xE7\u0131lacak."
      textEN: Synthesis complete. If I enter the code from the board into the Turing
        machine, the lock will open.
      textDE: "Deine Messung ist im Notizbuch. Lege sie in Turings Leseger\xE4t und
        best\xE4tige mit Enter."
  - id: thought_book_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / book
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "\u015Eu masadaki kitap... Belki burada ne oldu\u011Funu anlat\u0131yordur."
      textEN: That book on the desk... Maybe it can tell us what happened here.
      textDE: Das Buch auf dem Tisch... Vielleicht steht darin, was hier passiert
        ist.
  - id: thought_book_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / book
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Akl\u0131m h\xE2l\xE2 o kitapta. Sen hi\xE7 merak etmedin mi?"
      textEN: I'm still thinking about that book. Aren't you curious?
      textDE: Ich denke noch an das Buch. Bist du gar nicht neugierig?
  - id: thought_book_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / book
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Hemen \xF6n\xFCndeki masada. Kitaba t\u0131klay\u0131nca birlikte
        bakabiliriz."
      textEN: On the desk right in front of you. Click the book and we can take a
        look.
      textDE: Auf dem Tisch direkt vor dir. Klick auf das Buch, dann sehen wir gemeinsam
        nach.
  - id: thought_collect_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / collect
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Hedef, ba\u011Flant\u0131 notu ve \xFC\xE7 par\xE7a... Bunlar defterinde
        dursa iyi olur. Tab ile a\xE7abiliyorsun."
      textEN: The target, connection note and three parts... We could keep them in
        your notebook. Tab opens it.
      textDE: "Das Ziel, die Verbindungsnotiz und drei Teile... Im Notizbuch w\xE4ren
        sie gut aufgehoben. Tab \xF6ffnet es."
  - id: thought_collect_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / collect
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Sayfalardaki notlar orada kalacak. Defterine s\xFCr\xFCklersen yan\u0131m\u0131zda
        da olur."
      textEN: Those notes will stay on the pages. Drag them into your notebook and
        we can take them with us.
      textDE: Die Notizen bleiben auf den Seiten. Ziehst du sie ins Notizbuch, haben
        wir sie auch dabei.
  - id: thought_collect_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / collect
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 7
      textTR: "Bir \u015Feyler eksik h\xE2l\xE2. Hedef, Ba\u011Flant\u0131 S\u0131ras\u0131
        ve yan sayfadaki \xFC\xE7 par\xE7a... Hepsi laz\u0131m olabilir."
      textEN: Something's still missing. The target, connection order and three parts
        on the other page... We may need all of them.
      textDE: Etwas fehlt noch. Ziel, Verbindungsfolge und die drei Teile auf der
        anderen Seite... Vielleicht brauchen wir alles.
  - id: thought_leave_book_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_book
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Tamam, hepsi yan\u0131m\u0131zda. \u015Eu kara tahtada bunlarla bir
        \u015Fey yapabiliriz."
      textEN: Good, we have everything. We could try something with these on that
        chalkboard.
      textDE: "Gut, wir haben alles. An der Tafel k\xF6nnten wir etwas damit versuchen."
  - id: thought_leave_book_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_book
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Kitaptaki i\u015Fimiz bitti gibi. F ile b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
        tahtaya ge\xE7ebiliriz."
      textEN: I think we're done with the book. F puts it down, then we can try the
        board.
      textDE: "Mit dem Buch sind wir wohl fertig. Mit F legst du es weg, dann k\xF6nnen
        wir zur Tafel."
  - id: thought_leave_book_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_book
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Notlar kaybolmayacak; defterindeler. F ile kitab\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131p
        etrafa bakabiliriz."
      textEN: The notes won't disappear; they're in your notebook. F lets us leave
        the book and look around.
      textDE: "Die Notizen verschwinden nicht; sie sind im Notizbuch. Mit F k\xF6nnen
        wir das Buch verlassen und uns umsehen."
  - id: thought_board_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Kara tahta... Belki bu par\xE7alar\u0131n nas\u0131l bir araya geldi\u011Fini
        orada anlayabiliriz."
      textEN: The chalkboard... Maybe we can work out how these pieces fit together
        there.
      textDE: Die Tafel... Vielleicht finden wir dort heraus, wie diese Teile zusammenpassen.
  - id: thought_board_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Tahtay\u0131 merak ediyorum. Kitaptan ald\u0131klar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131
        orada deneyebiliriz."
      textEN: I'm curious about the board. We could try out what we took from the
        book.
      textDE: "Die Tafel interessiert mich. Dort k\xF6nnten wir ausprobieren, was
        wir aus dem Buch haben."
  - id: thought_board_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\u015Eu kara tahtaya t\u0131klay\u0131nca \xE7al\u0131\u015Fabiliriz.
        Notlar\u0131n da defterinde; Tab ile elinin alt\u0131nda."
      textEN: Clicking that chalkboard lets us work. Your notes are in the notebook;
        Tab brings them up.
      textDE: "Ein Klick auf die Tafel l\xE4sst uns arbeiten. Die Notizen sind im
        Notizbuch; Tab holt sie hervor."
  - id: thought_pin_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / pin
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Hedefle ba\u011Flant\u0131 notunu \u015Fu panoda yan yana g\xF6rebilsek,
        d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmek daha kolay olurdu."
      textEN: It would be easier to think with the target and connection note side
        by side on that panel.
      textDE: "Mit Ziel und Verbindungsnotiz nebeneinander an der Pinnwand k\xF6nnten
        wir besser nachdenken."
  - id: thought_pin_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / pin
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Defterde Hedefler ve Bilgiler vard\u0131. \u0130kisindeki notlar\u0131
        panoya ta\u015F\u0131yabiliriz."
      textEN: Your notebook had Targets and Information. We can move a note from
        each onto the panel.
      textDE: "Im Notizbuch gab es Ziele und Informationen. Je eine Notiz daraus
        k\xF6nnen wir an die Pinnwand ziehen."
  - id: thought_pin_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / pin
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Hedef ve Ba\u011Flant\u0131 S\u0131ras\u0131... \u0130kisi de panoya
        s\xFCr\xFCklendi\u011Finde g\xF6z\xFCm\xFCz\xFCn \xF6n\xFCnde olacak."
      textEN: The target and connection order... Drag both onto the panel and we'll
        have them in sight.
      textDE: Ziel und Verbindungsfolge... Ziehen wir beide an die Pinnwand, haben
        wir sie vor Augen.
  - id: thought_clear_board_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / clear_board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\u015Eimdi \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzde yer olsa iyi olur. Panonun \xFCst\xFCndeki
        tutamak belgeleri topluyor galiba."
      textEN: We could use some room now. I think that handle above the panel folds
        the documents away.
      textDE: "Jetzt k\xF6nnten wir Platz gebrauchen. Der Griff \xFCber der Pinnwand
        klappt die Unterlagen wohl zusammen."
  - id: thought_clear_board_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / clear_board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\u015Eu BELGELER\u0130 TOPLA tutama\u011F\u0131... Notlar dururken
        \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7abiliriz."
      textEN: "That BELGELER\u0130 TOPLA handle... We can clear the working area
        without losing the notes."
      textDE: "Dieser Griff BELGELER\u0130 TOPLA... Damit wird die Arbeitsfl\xE4che
        frei, ohne dass die Notizen verschwinden."
  - id: thought_clear_board_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / clear_board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Panoyu tutamaktan kapat\u0131nca par\xE7alara yer a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor.
        Sonra tekrar bakabiliriz."
      textEN: Closing the panel with its handle makes room for the parts. We can
        open it again later.
      textDE: "Klappen wir die Pinnwand am Griff zu, ist Platz f\xFCr die Teile.
        Sp\xE4ter k\xF6nnen wir wieder nachsehen."
  - id: thought_build_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / build
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\xDC\xE7 par\xE7ay\u0131 defterden tahtaya ta\u015F\u0131yabiliriz.
        Nas\u0131l ba\u011Flanacaklar\u0131 ald\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z notta yaz\u0131yordu."
      textEN: We can bring the three parts from your notebook onto the board. That
        note had the connection order.
      textDE: "Die drei Teile k\xF6nnen vom Notizbuch auf die Tafel. Die Reihenfolge
        stand auf unserer Notiz."
  - id: thought_build_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / build
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Oklar \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F, halkalar giri\u015F... Aralar\u0131n\u0131
        s\xFCr\xFCkleyerek ba\u011Flayabiliriz. Sonucu merak ediyorum."
      textEN: Arrows are outputs, rings are inputs... We can drag between them to
        connect them. I'm curious what we'll get.
      textDE: "Pfeile sind Ausg\xE4nge, Ringe Eing\xE4nge... Dazwischen ziehen verbindet
        sie. Ich bin gespannt auf das Ergebnis."
  - id: thought_build_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / build
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 7
      textTR: "Ba\u011Flant\u0131 notuna bir daha bakabiliriz. DENEY\u0130 \xD6L\xC7
        sonucu g\xF6steriyor; yanl\u0131\u015F ba\u011F\u0131 sa\u011F t\u0131kla
        silebiliyorsun."
      textEN: "We could check the connection note again. DENEY\u0130 \xD6L\xC7 measures
        it; right-click removes a wrong connection."
      textDE: "Wir k\xF6nnten die Verbindungsnotiz pr\xFCfen. DENEY\u0130 \xD6L\xC7
        misst das Ergebnis; ein Rechtsklick entfernt falsche Verbindungen."
  - id: thought_store_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / store
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\u0130\u015Fte bu iz... \u0130\u015Fimize yarayacak. \xD6l\xE7\xFCm
        ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131n\u0131 defterinde saklayabiliriz."
      textEN: That trace... We'll need it. We can keep the measurement paper in your
        notebook.
      textDE: "Diese Spur... Die werden wir brauchen. Das Messblatt k\xF6nnen wir
        im Notizbuch aufheben."
  - id: thought_store_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / store
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "O ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 burada b\u0131rak\u0131rsak geri d\xF6nmemiz
        gerekir. Defterine s\xFCr\xFCklemek daha iyi olabilir."
      textEN: If we leave that paper here, we'll have to come back. Dragging it into
        your notebook might be better.
      textDE: "Lassen wir das Blatt hier, m\xFCssen wir zur\xFCck. Im Notizbuch w\xE4re
        es wohl besser aufgehoben."
  - id: thought_store_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / store
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Tahtadaki \xF6l\xE7\xFCm ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 h\xE2l\xE2 orada. Defterine
        s\xFCr\xFCkleyince yan\u0131m\u0131zda olacak."
      textEN: The measurement paper is still on the board. Drag it into your notebook
        and we can take it along.
      textDE: Das Messblatt liegt noch an der Tafel. Ziehst du es ins Notizbuch,
        haben wir es dabei.
  - id: thought_leave_board_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\xD6l\xE7\xFCm defterde. Burada biraz fazla kald\u0131k sanki... Kap\u0131ya
        da bir baksak iyi olur."
      textEN: The measurement's in your notebook. We've been here a while... We should
        probably check the door.
      textDE: "Die Messung ist im Notizbuch. Wir sind schon eine Weile hier... Ein
        Blick zur T\xFCr w\xE4re wohl gut."
  - id: thought_leave_board_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Tahtadaki i\u015Fimiz \u015Fimdilik bitti. F ile buradan ayr\u0131labiliriz."
      textEN: I think we're done with the board for now. F lets us leave.
      textDE: "An der Tafel sind wir vorerst fertig. Mit F k\xF6nnen wir sie verlassen."
  - id: thought_leave_board_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_board
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Notlar\u0131n g\xFCvende. F ile tahtadan \xE7\u0131k\u0131nca kap\u0131ya
        bakabiliriz."
      textEN: Your notes are safe. Once we leave the board with F, we can check the
        door.
      textDE: "Die Notizen sind sicher. Verlassen wir die Tafel mit F, k\xF6nnen
        wir nach der T\xFCr sehen."
  - id: thought_lock_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / lock
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Kap\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n... Buraya birinin rahat\xE7a
        girebilmesi ho\u015Fuma gitmiyor."
      textEN: That door... I don't like how easily someone could walk in here.
      textDE: "Diese T\xFCr... Mir gef\xE4llt nicht, wie leicht hier jemand hereinkommen
        k\xF6nnte."
  - id: thought_lock_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / lock
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n kilidini fark ettin mi? Kendimi biraz daha g\xFCvende
        hissetmek isterdim."
      textEN: Did you notice the lock? I'd feel a little safer if that door were
        locked.
      textDE: "Hast du das Schloss bemerkt? Mit verriegelter T\xFCr w\xFCrde ich
        mich etwas sicherer f\xFChlen."
  - id: thought_lock_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / lock
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Ofis kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n \xFCzerindeki kilit... \xDCzerine t\u0131klamak
        yeterli olmal\u0131."
      textEN: The lock on the office door... A click on it should do it.
      textDE: "Das Schloss an der B\xFCrot\xFCr... Ein Klick darauf m\xFCsste gen\xFCgen."
  - id: thought_hide_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / hide
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Ayak sesleri... Sen de duydun, de\u011Fil mi? \u015Eu dolapta bizi
        g\xF6remeyebilir."
      textEN: Footsteps... You heard them too, right? They might not see us in that
        wardrobe.
      textDE: "Schritte... Du hast sie auch geh\xF6rt, oder? Im Schrank sieht man
        uns vielleicht nicht."
  - id: thought_hide_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / hide
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Yakla\u015F\u0131yor. Dolap h\xE2l\xE2 hemen orada..."
      textEN: It's getting closer. The wardrobe's still right there...
      textDE: "Es kommt n\xE4her. Der Schrank ist noch direkt dort..."
  - id: thought_hide_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / hide
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\u0130\u015Faretli dolaba t\u0131klayabiliriz. \u015Eu an g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr
        olmak istemiyorum."
      textEN: We can click the marked wardrobe. I really don't want to be seen right
        now.
      textDE: "Wir k\xF6nnen auf den markierten Schrank klicken. Ich m\xF6chte gerade
        wirklich nicht gesehen werden."
  - id: thought_wait_hidden_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / wait_hidden
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Ben buraday\u0131m. Biraz daha sessiz kalal\u0131m... D\u0131\u015Far\u0131da
        h\xE2l\xE2 biri var."
      textEN: I'm here. Let's stay quiet a little longer... Someone's still out there.
      textDE: "Ich bin hier. Bleiben wir noch etwas leise... Drau\xDFen ist noch
        jemand."
  - id: thought_wait_hidden_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / wait_hidden
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Hen\xFCz uzakla\u015Fmad\u0131. Burada beklemek daha iyi geliyor."
      textEN: They haven't gone yet. Staying here feels safer.
      textDE: "Noch ist niemand gegangen. Hier zu warten f\xFChlt sich sicherer an."
  - id: thought_wait_hidden_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / wait_hidden
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Sesleri dinliyorum. G\xFCvenli oldu\u011Funda sana s\xF6yleyece\u011Fim."
      textEN: I'm listening. I'll tell you when it feels safe.
      textDE: "Ich h\xF6re zu. Ich sage dir, wenn es sicher scheint."
  - id: thought_leave_hiding_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_hiding
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Sesler uzakla\u015Ft\u0131. San\u0131r\u0131m art\u0131k d\u0131\u015Far\u0131
        bakabiliriz."
      textEN: The footsteps have faded. I think we can look outside now.
      textDE: "Die Schritte sind verklungen. Ich glaube, wir k\xF6nnen wieder nach
        drau\xDFen sehen."
  - id: thought_leave_hiding_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_hiding
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Art\u0131k kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde kimseyi duymuyorum. \xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F
        i\xE7in F vard\u0131, hat\u0131rl\u0131yor musun?"
      textEN: I can't hear anyone by the door now. F was the way out, remember?
      textDE: "Ich h\xF6re niemanden mehr vor der T\xFCr. Mit F geht es hinaus, erinnerst
        du dich?"
  - id: thought_leave_hiding_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_hiding
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Burada kalmak zorunda de\u011Filiz. F ile dolaptan \xE7\u0131kabiliyorsun."
      textEN: We don't have to stay in here. F lets you leave the wardrobe.
      textDE: "Wir m\xFCssen nicht hierbleiben. Mit F kannst du den Schrank verlassen."
  - id: thought_notice_lees_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / notice_lees
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Bir saniye... Odada bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fti. Yaln\u0131z oldu\u011Fumuzdan
        emin de\u011Filim."
      textEN: Wait a second... Something in the room has changed. I'm not sure we're
        alone.
      textDE: "Warte kurz... Im Raum hat sich etwas ver\xE4ndert. Ich bin nicht sicher,
        ob wir allein sind."
  - id: thought_notice_lees_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / notice_lees
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Odada bir \u015Fey var. Sen de g\xF6rd\xFCn m\xFC?"
      textEN: There's something in the room. Did you see it too?
      textDE: Da ist etwas im Raum. Hast du es auch gesehen?
  - id: thought_notice_lees_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / notice_lees
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Etraf\u0131na bakarken dikkatli ol... Birinin varl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
        hissediyorum."
      textEN: Be careful looking around... I can feel someone here.
      textDE: "Vorsicht beim Umsehen... Ich sp\xFCre, dass hier jemand ist."
  - id: thought_avoid_lees_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / avoid_lees
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Lees... Ona bakmak iyi gelmiyor. Bak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 \xE7evirsek...
        ve bir s\xFCre k\u0131p\u0131rdamasak."
      textEN: Lees... Looking at him feels wrong. Maybe look away... and stay still
        for a moment.
      textDE: "Lees... Ihn anzusehen f\xFChlt sich falsch an. Vielleicht wegsehen...
        und einen Moment stillhalten."
  - id: thought_avoid_lees_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / avoid_lees
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "G\xF6zlerin h\xE2l\xE2 onda m\u0131? Ben olsam ba\u015Fka yere bak\u0131p
        sessizce beklerdim."
      textEN: Are your eyes still on him? I'd look somewhere else and wait quietly.
      textDE: "Siehst du ihn noch an? Ich w\xFCrde woanders hinsehen und leise warten."
  - id: thought_avoid_lees_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / avoid_lees
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131 ondan \xE7evirince ve hareket etmeyince uzakla\u015Fabilir...
        Buraday\u0131m."
      textEN: He might leave if you look away and stop moving... I'm here.
      textDE: Vielleicht geht er, wenn du wegsiehst und dich nicht bewegst... Ich
        bin hier.
  - id: thought_turing_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / turing
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Tamam... \xD6l\xE7\xFCm\xFC h\xE2l\xE2 ta\u015F\u0131yoruz. Turing'in
        o ka\u011F\u0131ttan ne \xE7\u0131karaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 merak ediyorum."
      textEN: All right... We still have the measurement. I wonder what Turing will
        make of that paper.
      textDE: Gut... Die Messung haben wir noch. Ich frage mich, was Turing aus dem
        Blatt macht.
  - id: thought_turing_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / turing
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Tahtadan ald\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z ka\u011F\u0131t defterde. \u015Eu
        Turing makinesinde deneyebiliriz."
      textEN: The paper from the board is in your notebook. We could try it in that
        Turing machine.
      textDE: "Das Blatt von der Tafel ist im Notizbuch. Wir k\xF6nnten es an der
        Turing-Maschine versuchen."
  - id: thought_turing_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / turing
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Turing'e t\u0131klay\u0131nca okuyucuya ula\u015Fabiliriz. \xD6l\xE7\xFCm
        de defterindeki \xD6l\xE7\xFCmler b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCnde."
      textEN: Click Turing and we can reach its reader. The paper is under Measurements
        in your notebook.
      textDE: "Ein Klick auf Turing f\xFChrt zum Leseger\xE4t. Das Blatt liegt unter
        Messungen im Notizbuch."
  - id: thought_insert_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / insert
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Sol klavyedeki okuyucu... \xD6l\xE7\xFCm ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 oraya
        uyacak gibi g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor."
      textEN: The reader on the left keyboard... That measurement paper looks like
        it would fit.
      textDE: "Das Leseger\xE4t auf der linken Tastatur... Das Messblatt scheint
        dort hineinzupassen."
  - id: thought_insert_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / insert
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Defterinin \xD6l\xE7\xFCmler b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCndeki \u0130lk \u0130z
        ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131n\u0131 okuyucuya ta\u015F\u0131yabiliriz."
      textEN: We can move the First Trace paper from Measurements in your notebook
        into the reader.
      textDE: "Das Blatt Erste Spur unter Messungen im Notizbuch k\xF6nnen wir ins
        Leseger\xE4t ziehen."
  - id: thought_insert_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / insert
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 sol klavyedeki yuvaya s\xFCr\xFCkleyince makine
        kendisi okumaya ba\u015Fl\u0131yor."
      textEN: Dragging the paper to that slot on the left keyboard lets the machine
        read it.
      textDE: Zieht man das Blatt in den Schlitz auf der linken Tastatur, liest die
        Maschine es selbst ein.
  - id: thought_reader_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / reader
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\xC7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yor... Ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 okumay\u0131
        bitirmesini bekleyelim. Ben de sonucu merak ediyorum."
      textEN: It's working... Let's give it time to read the paper. I'm curious about
        the result too.
      textDE: Sie arbeitet... Geben wir ihr Zeit zum Lesen. Ich bin auch auf das
        Ergebnis gespannt.
  - id: thought_reader_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / reader
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "H\xE2l\xE2 okuyor. \u015Eimdilik makineye biraz zaman verebiliriz."
      textEN: It's still reading. We can give the machine a little more time.
      textDE: "Sie liest noch. Wir k\xF6nnen der Maschine noch etwas Zeit geben."
  - id: thought_reader_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / reader
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Kod yerle\u015Fince haz\u0131r olacak. \u015Eu an i\u015Flemi bitiriyor
        gibi."
      textEN: Once the code settles, it'll be ready. It seems to be finishing up.
      textDE: Sobald der Code steht, ist sie bereit. Sie scheint gerade fertig zu
        werden.
  - id: thought_confirm_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / confirm
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Kod yerle\u015Fti. Enter ile s\u0131nay\u0131nca elimizdekinin do\u011Fru
        olup olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 \xF6\u011Frenebiliriz."
      textEN: The code's in place. Enter should tell us whether our measurement holds
        up.
      textDE: Der Code steht. Mit Enter erfahren wir wohl, ob unsere Messung stimmt.
  - id: thought_confirm_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / confirm
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Haz\u0131r g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor. Sonucu g\xF6rmek i\xE7in Enter kalm\u0131\u015F
        olmal\u0131."
      textEN: It looks ready. I think Enter is all that's left before we see the
        result.
      textDE: Sieht bereit aus. Ich glaube, nur Enter fehlt noch bis zum Ergebnis.
  - id: thought_close_door_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / close_door
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "Dur, kap\u0131y\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k b\u0131rakmayal\u0131m. Kapal\u0131yken biri gelirse en az\u0131ndan ayak seslerini duyar\u0131z."
      textEN: "Wait, let's not leave the door open. If it's shut, at least we'll hear someone coming."
      textDE: "Warte, lassen wir die T\xFCr nicht offen. Ist sie zu, h\xF6ren wir wenigstens, wenn jemand kommt."
  - id: thought_confirm_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / confirm
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Okuma bitti, ama hen\xFCz s\u0131namad\u0131k. Enter'a bas\u0131nca
        Turing karar\u0131n\u0131 verecek."
      textEN: It's finished reading, but we haven't tested it yet. Enter lets Turing
        give its verdict.
      textDE: "Das Lesen ist fertig, gepr\xFCft haben wir noch nicht. Mit Enter f\xE4llt
        Turing sein Urteil."
  - id: thought_valve_room_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / valve_room
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\u015Eu bas\u0131n\xE7 sesi... Vana odas\u0131ndan geliyor olabilir.
        Oraya baksak iyi olur."
      textEN: That pressure noise... It might be coming from the valve room. We should
        have a look.
      textDE: "Dieses Druckger\xE4usch... Es kommt vielleicht aus dem Ventilraum.
        Ein Blick dorthin w\xE4re gut."
  - id: thought_valve_room_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / valve_room
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Vana odas\u0131na giden kap\u0131 i\u015Faretliydi. Ses oradan geliyor
        gibi."
      textEN: The door to the valve room was marked. The sound seems to be coming
        from there.
      textDE: "Die T\xFCr zum Ventilraum war markiert. Das Ger\xE4usch scheint von
        dort zu kommen."
  - id: thought_valve_room_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / valve_room
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\u0130\u015Faretli kap\u0131dan ge\xE7ince vanalara ula\u015Fabiliriz.
        Bu sesi burada b\u0131rakmak i\xE7ime sinmiyor."
      textEN: The marked door leads to the valves. I don't feel right ignoring that
        sound.
      textDE: "Durch die markierte T\xFCr kommen wir zu den Ventilen. Das Ger\xE4usch
        zu ignorieren f\xFChlt sich falsch an."
  - id: thought_valve_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / valve
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "G\xF6sterge hi\xE7 iyi g\xF6r\xFCnm\xFCyor. Vanay\u0131 \xE7evirsek
        bas\u0131n\xE7 d\xFC\u015Fer mi dersin?"
      textEN: That gauge doesn't look good. Do you think turning the valve would
        lower the pressure?
      textDE: "Die Anzeige sieht nicht gut aus. Ob sich der Druck durch Drehen am
        Ventil senken l\xE4sst?"
  - id: thought_valve_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / valve
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 6
      textTR: "\u0130bre h\xE2l\xE2 y\xFCksek. Vanaya t\u0131klay\u0131p fareyle
        \xE7evirince hareket etmesi gerekiyor."
      textEN: The needle's still high. Clicking the valve and turning with the mouse
        should move it.
      textDE: Der Zeiger steht noch hoch. Ein Klick aufs Ventil und Drehen mit der
        Maus sollte ihn bewegen.
  - id: thought_valve_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / valve
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Yirmi ya da alt\u0131... \u0130bre oraya inince biraz rahatlayabiliriz."
      textEN: Twenty or below... We can breathe easier once the needle gets there.
      textDE: "Zwanzig oder weniger... Ist der Zeiger dort, k\xF6nnen wir etwas aufatmen."
  - id: thought_leave_valve_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_valve
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "\u0130bre indi. Tamam, bu daha iyi... F ile vanay\u0131 b\u0131rakabiliriz."
      textEN: The needle's down. That's better... F lets us leave the valve.
      textDE: "Der Zeiger ist gesunken. Schon besser... Mit F k\xF6nnen wir das Ventil
        loslassen."
  - id: thought_leave_valve_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_valve
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Bas\u0131n\xE7 art\u0131k yeterince d\xFC\u015F\xFCk. Burada daha
        fazla kalmam\u0131z gerekmiyor gibi."
      textEN: The pressure's low enough now. I don't think we need to stay here.
      textDE: "Der Druck ist jetzt niedrig genug. Ich glaube, wir m\xFCssen nicht
        l\xE4nger hierbleiben."
  - id: thought_leave_valve_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / leave_valve
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Vanadaki i\u015Fimiz bitti. F ile geri \xE7ekilebiliriz."
      textEN: We're done with the valve. F lets us step back.
      textDE: "Am Ventil sind wir fertig. Mit F k\xF6nnen wir zur\xFCcktreten."
  - id: thought_wait_power_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / wait_power
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: Bu sessizlik... Bir an dinleyelim.
      textEN: That silence... Let's listen for a moment.
      textDE: "Diese Stille... H\xF6ren wir einen Moment hin."
  - id: thought_wait_power_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / wait_power
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Bir \u015Fey olacakm\u0131\u015F gibi geliyor. Sen de hissediyor musun?"
      textEN: It feels like something's about to happen. Do you feel it too?
      textDE: "Es f\xFChlt sich an, als w\xFCrde gleich etwas passieren. Sp\xFCrst
        du es auch?"
  - id: thought_wait_power_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / wait_power
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "H\xE2l\xE2 buraday\u0131m. Biraz etrafa bakabiliriz."
      textEN: I'm still here. We can take a look around.
      textDE: "Ich bin noch hier. Wir k\xF6nnen uns etwas umsehen."
  - id: thought_breaker_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / breaker
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "I\u015F\u0131klar... San\u0131r\u0131m sigorta att\u0131. Ana \u015Falter
        sigorta odas\u0131nda olmal\u0131."
      textEN: The lights... I think the breaker tripped. The main switch should be
        in the breaker room.
      textDE: "Das Licht... Ich glaube, die Sicherung ist raus. Der Hauptschalter
        m\xFCsste im Sicherungsraum sein."
  - id: thought_breaker_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / breaker
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Karanl\u0131kta kalmak i\xE7ime sinmiyor. Sigorta odas\u0131na bakabiliriz."
      textEN: I don't like staying in the dark. We could check the breaker room.
      textDE: "Mir gef\xE4llt es nicht, im Dunkeln zu bleiben. Wir k\xF6nnten im
        Sicherungsraum nachsehen."
  - id: thought_breaker_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / breaker
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Sigorta odas\u0131ndaki ana \u015Faltere t\u0131klay\u0131nca elektri\u011Fi
        geri getirebiliriz."
      textEN: Clicking the main switch in the breaker room should bring the power
        back.
      textDE: "Ein Klick auf den Hauptschalter im Sicherungsraum sollte den Strom
        zur\xFCckbringen."
  - id: thought_retry_measurement_0
    note: Tutorial inner companion / rejected measurement
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 8
      textTR: "Bu kay\u0131t uymad\u0131. Defterdeki \u0130lk \u0130z \xF6l\xE7\xFCmlerinden
        hedefe uyan\u0131 se\xE7memiz gerekiyor."
      textEN: That record didn't match. We need the First Trace measurement that
        meets the target in your notebook.
      textDE: Diese Aufzeichnung passt nicht. Wir brauchen die Messung Erste Spur
        im Notizbuch, die dem Ziel entspricht.
  - id: thought_retry_measurement_1
    note: Tutorial inner companion / rejected measurement
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 9
      textTR: "Birden fazla deneme vard\u0131. Tek k\u0131sa iz \xE7\u0131kan \xF6l\xE7\xFCm
        ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131n\u0131 yeniden okuyucuya b\u0131rakabiliriz."
      textEN: We made more than one attempt. We can feed the paper with one short
        trace into the reader again.
      textDE: "Wir hatten mehrere Versuche. Das Messblatt mit einer kurzen Spur k\xF6nnen
        wir erneut ins Leseger\xE4t legen."
  - id: thought_retry_measurement_2
    note: Tutorial inner companion / rejected measurement
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    segments:
    - duration: 9
      textTR: "Ayn\u0131 kayd\u0131 tekrar onaylay\u0131nca sonu\xE7 de\u011Fi\u015Fmiyor.
        \xD6l\xE7\xFCmler b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCndeki do\u011Fru ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 deneyebiliriz."
      textEN: Confirming the same record won't change the result. We could try the
        matching paper under Measurements.
      textDE: "Dieselbe Aufzeichnung erneut zu best\xE4tigen \xE4ndert nichts. Wir
        k\xF6nnten das passende Blatt unter Messungen versuchen."
